      "summaryMarkdown": {
        "id": 1447981866,
        "html": "<p>The CPIC Dosing Guideline for clopidogrel recommends an alternative antiplatelet therapy for CYP2C19 poor or intermediate metabolizers (cardiovascular indications: prasugrel or ticagrelor if no contraindication; neurovascular indications: alternative P2Y12 inhibitor if clinically indicated and no contraindication.)</p>\n"
